      "id": "song-722",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "浪淘沙",
      "subtitle": "今日北池游漾漾",
      "author": "欧阳修",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "今日北池游。\n漾漾轻舟。\n波光潋滟柳条柔。\n如此春来春又去，白了人头。\n好妓好歌喉。\n不醉难休。\n劝君满满酌金瓯。\n纵使花时常病酒，也是风流。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "e96e86e230f01a2b0b12ff871f05ff341b4575f69e347fd679f18c39fe1c19b9",
      "estimatedOutput": 742,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-722--e96e86e230f01a2b0b12ff871f05ff341b4575f69e347fd679f18c39fe1c19b9.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-723",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "定风波",
      "subtitle": "把酒花前欲问他",
      "author": "欧阳修",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "把酒花前欲问他。\n对花何吝醉颜酡。\n春到几人能烂赏。\n何况。\n无情风雨等闲多。\n艳树香丛都几许。\n朝暮。\n惜红愁粉奈情何。\n好是金船浮玉浪。\n相向。\n十分深送一声歌。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "f85dd11dae280608c067c5a01001f56788e1ebbac10dcf42329d5ef4ce5fbc9e",
      "estimatedOutput": 766,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-723--f85dd11dae280608c067c5a01001f56788e1ebbac10dcf42329d5ef4ce5fbc9e.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-724",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "定风波",
      "subtitle": "把酒花前欲问伊",
      "author": "欧阳修",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "把酒花前欲问伊。\n忍嫌金盏负春时。\n红颜不能旬日看。\n宜算。\n须知开谢只相随。\n蝶去蝶来犹解恋。\n难见。\n回头还是度年期。\n莫候饮阑花已尽。\n方信。\n无人堪与补残枝。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "8855966d84d99b6fd28a86844064be63ae156df4cc8471ae9a74dbbbc4152398",
      "estimatedOutput": 766,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-724--8855966d84d99b6fd28a86844064be63ae156df4cc8471ae9a74dbbbc4152398.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-725",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "定风波",
      "subtitle": "把酒花前欲问公",
      "author": "欧阳修",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "把酒花前欲问公。\n对花何事诉金锺。\n为问去年春甚处。\n虚度。\n莺声撩乱一场空。\n今岁春来须爱惜。\n难得。\n须知花面不长红。\n待得酒醒君不见。\n千片。\n不随流水即随风。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "f2e0e90a200509335f98807a48cbba0dfcae77057f8cb13926b5da303dfec4e1",
      "estimatedOutput": 766,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-725--f2e0e90a200509335f98807a48cbba0dfcae77057f8cb13926b5da303dfec4e1.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-726",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "定风波",
      "subtitle": "把酒花前欲问君",
      "author": "欧阳修",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "把酒花前欲问君。\n世间何计可留春。\n纵使青春留得住。\n虚语。\n无情花对有情人。\n任是好花须落去。\n自古。\n红颜能得几时新。\n暗想浮生何时好。\n唯有。\n清歌一曲倒金尊。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "352ffbce574f4df646f909d9448c93c3301ca23d18fce2fb7309f26be815ea13",
      "estimatedOutput": 766,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-726--352ffbce574f4df646f909d9448c93c3301ca23d18fce2fb7309f26be815ea13.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-727",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "定风波",
      "subtitle": "过尽韶华不可添",
      "author": "欧阳修",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "过尽韶华不可添。\n小楼红日下层檐。\n春睡觉来情绪恶。\n寂寞。\n杨花缭乱拂珠帘。\n早是闲愁依旧在。\n无奈。\n那堪更被宿酲兼。\n把酒送春惆怅甚。\n长恁。\n年年三月病厌厌。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "c131a4f1a53271176728ce666e31f633dc23c1986315041f2e3f1636a30024c8",
      "estimatedOutput": 766,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-727--c131a4f1a53271176728ce666e31f633dc23c1986315041f2e3f1636a30024c8.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-728",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "定风波",
      "subtitle": "对酒追欢莫负春",
      "author": "欧阳修",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "对酒追欢莫负春。\n春光归去可饶人。\n昨日红芳今绿树。\n已暮。\n残花飞絮两纷纷。\n粉面丽姝歌窈窕。\n清妙。\n尊前信任醉醺醺。\n不是狂心贪燕乐。\n自觉。\n年来白发满头新。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "487aea20ab6def171938ba26a56c75d522be4e3088eefb4a91285cd4fa176685",
      "estimatedOutput": 766,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-728--487aea20ab6def171938ba26a56c75d522be4e3088eefb4a91285cd4fa176685.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-729",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "浣溪沙",
      "subtitle": "云曳香绵彩柱高",
      "author": "欧阳修",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "云曳香绵彩柱高。\n绛旗风飐出花梢。\n一梭红带往来抛。\n束素美人羞不打，却嫌裙慢褪纤腰。\n日斜深院影空摇。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "bdac0d97e228fab21daaf315158c0f66d5e5b180a3b111da0b6263913b7007c5",
      "estimatedOutput": 704,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-729--bdac0d97e228fab21daaf315158c0f66d5e5b180a3b111da0b6263913b7007c5.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-730",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "浣溪沙",
      "subtitle": "湖上朱桥响画轮",
      "author": "欧阳修",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "湖上朱桥响画轮。\n溶溶春水浸春云。\n碧琉璃滑净无尘。\n当路游丝萦醉客，隔花啼鸟唤行人。\n日斜归去奈何春。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "20b67f8f2a149bc49e94cdb2c25bfb0832ebef6067b2b5d1dc5a707b3750a608",
      "estimatedOutput": 704,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-730--20b67f8f2a149bc49e94cdb2c25bfb0832ebef6067b2b5d1dc5a707b3750a608.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-731",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "浣溪沙",
      "subtitle": "叶底青青杏子垂",
      "author": "欧阳修",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "叶底青青杏子垂。\n枝头薄薄柳绵飞。\n日高深院晚莺啼。\n堪恨风流成薄幸，断无消息道归期。\n托腮无语翠眉低。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "27f32125e2c24810fad1eeaa54c74fab56cbd2c7aadb0b6e1ed6ef4f010b4ed9",
      "estimatedOutput": 704,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-731--27f32125e2c24810fad1eeaa54c74fab56cbd2c7aadb0b6e1ed6ef4f010b4ed9.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-732",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "浣溪沙",
      "subtitle": "青杏园林著酒香",
      "author": "欧阳修",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "青杏园林著酒香。\n佳人初著薄罗裳。\n柳丝摇曳燕飞忙。\n乍雨乍晴花自落，闲愁闲闷昼偏长。\n为谁消瘦损容光。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "cc831defda07bff5c83d26f4a26a776253590d73be825e4576477bbf96152fd2",
      "estimatedOutput": 704,
      "resultPath": "expansion/working/v2/results/song-732--cc831defda07bff5c83d26f4a26a776253590d73be825e4576477bbf96152fd2.json"
    },
    {
      "id": "song-733",
      "category": "宋词",
      "title": "浣溪沙",
      "subtitle": "红粉佳人白玉杯",
      "author": "欧阳修",
      "dynasty": "宋",
      "content": "红粉佳人白玉杯。\n木兰船稳棹歌催。\n绿荷风里笑声来。\n细雨轻烟笼草树，斜桥曲水绕楼台。\n夕阳高处画屏开。",
      "excerptOf": null,
      "excerptNote": "",
      "inputHash": "a1bc98baca135757f20d82cd0e05384821f7a1433d77114f3c3db7b397cf5ca2",
